## Intro :

Disable the new Create World Menu added in 1.19.4 !

This mod adds the old menu for the world creation screen to version 1.19.4 and later. It is an exact copy of the old menu!

Feature:
- Add the old menu (see image).
- Add configuration for enable/disable the new menu.
- Change (enable/disable feature) whenever you want directly in game without restart the game!
- Add "experimental" button to the old menu, you will find it in "more world option".
- Authentic, no extras, just the old menu (or the new menu if you change the config)
